# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MetaBite - environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is git-ignored; this file is the
# only env file that is tracked, and it must never contain real values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Every variable below is prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ because Expo inlines only those
# into the client bundle at build time. That means they are NOT secret: they ship
# inside the APK and can be read straight out of it. What protects your data is
# row level security on the database, not the obscurity of these keys.
#
# Scope each key to the least privilege that works, and rotate it if it leaks.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Supabase -------------------------------------------------------------
# Project URL and publishable (anon) key: Supabase dashboard > Project Settings
# > API. The publishable key is designed to be public.
#
# Do NOT put an `sb_secret_` key here. It bypasses row level security and must
# never reach a client build.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_YOUR_KEY_HERE

# --- Google Gemini (the vision model) --------------------------------------
# Free key, no credit card required: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# IMPORTANT: the free tier allows only ~20 generateContent requests per model
# per DAY, and the counter resets at midnight Pacific. The app walks a fallback
# chain of models when one is exhausted, and caches repeat scans of the same
# photo, so a normal week of use stays inside the allowance.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY

# Which model answers. Overridable without a code change.
# The original brief asked for gemini-1.5-flash, which is retired and now errors.
# For image calorie estimation Gemini 3.x Flash beats 2.5
# (calorie CCC 0.767 vs 0.718, MAE 81 vs 111 kcal); 2.x is flagged for
# deprecation. 3.5-flash currently answers 503 on free keys, hence 3.8.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash

# --- USDA FoodData Central (authoritative macro source) --------------------
# Free key: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-guide-signup.html
# Without it the USDA cross-check is skipped and consensus runs on
# Open Food Facts alone.
EXPO_PUBLIC_USDA_API_KEY=YOUR_USDA_API_KEY

# --- Spoonacular (micronutrients) ------------------------------------------
# Free key, 1500 requests/day: https://spoonacular.com/food-api
#
# OPTIONAL, and currently the weakest link: it is the only source that reports
# per-ingredient vitamins and minerals, so enabling it measurably improves the
# micronutrient panel. If the key is missing or rejected the app degrades
# gracefully and latches the source off for the rest of the session rather than
# retrying a doomed request for every ingredient on every scan.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SPOONACULAR_API_KEY=YOUR_SPOONACULAR_API_KEY
